# Force LF line endings on Linux-runtime artifacts so Windows clones
# with core.autocrlf=true don't break scripts deployed to the POC box
# OR shipped inside Docker images.
#
# Union of both branches' rules:
#  - POC (feat/poc-single-box) added the extensionless attach script
#    that the photo-studio box's systemd unit invokes
#  - feat/dashboard-redesign broadened coverage to Python services,
#    Dockerfiles, and YAML compose files
*.sh text eol=lf
*.service text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
openwrt/poc-single-box/droplet-openwrt-attach text eol=lf
